{
  "$comment": "DRAFT Twi (Asante) red-flag rules (FR-05, PRD 9.1 layer 1). NOT CLINICALLY APPROVED and NOT YET REVIEWED BY A NATIVE SPEAKER: seed list for the local demo only. English rules (en.json) always run as well, because Twi speakers often code-switch, so this file only adds Twi wording. Matching rules are the same as en.json (normalised text, whole words; see en.json $comment). Many people type Twi without the special letters, so patterns accept both ɛ/e and ɔ/o. Apostrophes are removed by normalisation, so n'anim is written nanim.",
